      "message": "JSON_ACTIONS has no completeness guard: removing an entry, or removing an action\u0027s JSON branch, both fail the suite today, but adding a tenth action without a branch would not be caught. A parametrized test over sorted(QuadsCli.JSON_ACTIONS) asserting run(action, {..., json_output: True}) \u003d\u003d 0 and json.loads(out) succeeding locks it in for future actions.",
